<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia CARTE insurance has higher 96 net.</title>
<headline>Tunisia CARTE insurance has higher 96 net.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia's Compagnie d'Assurances et de Reassurances Tuniso-Europeenne (CARTE) net profits in 1996 amounted to 3.11 million dinars, up from 2.52 million dinars in 1995, provisional results showed on Monday.</p>
<p>Its total balance sheet was 66.80 million dinars in 1996.</p>
<p>CARTE's investment certificates were last traded at the Tunis Stock Exchange at 37.54 dinars.</p>
<p>The privately-owned company has a capital totalling 24.29 million dinars. ($=1.08 dinar)</p>
</text>
